abstract: >-
  An independent reproduction of DenseVLM (ICCV 2025) Table 1 on a single 8 GB GPU,
  including the EVA-CLIP and CLIPSelf baseline rows, the attention-backend equivalence
  check, and a documented account of which tables are out of reach on this hardware.
